<title>UK: BFG Hypo sets 100 mln mark step-up Aug 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>BFG Hypo sets 100 mln mark step-up Aug 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager WGZ Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BFG HYPOTHEKENBANK, FRANKFURT</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     *4.25     MATURITY  **28.AUG.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    28.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    FFURT     DENOMS (M)  ONE</p>
<p> NOTES     *TO 28.AUG.97 THEN STEPS-UP 4.7 PCT</p>
<p>	    **CALLABLE AT PAR ON 28.AUG.97</p>
<p>		 OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 198.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
